# Manang Ana - Unified Social Visit & Tambayan Smalltalk Timeline
# Voice: Quietly warm, observant, genuine Nanay voice. Zero superficial exclamation crutches.

label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	ManangAna: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
	ManangAna: Not buying anything right now, anak. Just hiding under your awning for two quiet minutes.
	ManangAna: My four teenagers are debating who gets the electric fan at home, and I chose peace.
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
	ManangAna: Walking back from the wet market, anak. Have you had real rice yet, or just snacks from your own rack?
	ManangAna: Watch your stomach, ha. Nobody else is opening these shutters if you catch a fever.
else:
	ManangAna: Nice seeing a lamp burning behind this counter again, anak.
	ManangAna: Used to chat with your Lola right here whenever the soup pots were simmering slow.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
	ManangAna: Calf cramp finally let go, anak. Back to my kitchen I go.
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
	ManangAna: Break's over before my four kids start wondering where dinner went. Take care, anak.
else:
	ManangAna: Good catching my breath here, anak. Pull up a stool whenever the road goes quiet.
[end_timeline]
